    },
    "body": "The connected geometric NoRead producer had not been fitted through actual answer loss. This adds a separate Rust fixed-dose driver and records two completed640-update scalar fits on frozen1280-update context/value/output parents. Only754 shadows enter AdamW; exact parent RNG, original sampler, checkpoints and saved controls are retained. The delivered no-fit comparator is unchanged.\n\nFitted source/native answers98/104 and128/128 reproduce all512 legacy-parent predictions. Relative to zero initialization, seed1 restores row113 and loses72/102; other predictions remain unchanged. CE is mixed. A copied scalar-only geometric-feature ablation preserves context/addresses/values and reverses those three changes. This establishes a learned compiled replacement boundary, not a geometric advantage, semantic absence or complete serving result. All fitted, zero, ablated and negative cases are retained; this comparison ends without another scalar sweep.\n\nValidation: release example build, two focused mask/RNG and selected clipping/projection cases, and both actual-parent zero-update backward/reload checks pass. Both fits complete640 backward batches with independent source/native reload, frozen file/parameter checks and sealed verified reports. Measured wrappers8.846/9.054s, maximumRSS231374848bytes. Independent result audit checks512 rows, all640 input/RNG links perseed, checkpoints and frozen identities. Source/native scalar difference reaches11Q24units; downstream arithmetic also includes real softmax versus integer reduction. Formatting and claim-wording checks pass.\n\nNext is geometric attention read-output composition and explicit remaining coefficient-width qualification, retaining offline donor compilation. Float trunk/output, bounded access, natural inputs and language/energy remain unresolved. Claude's session files are untouched.\n\nReferences #1512, #973.\n",
